+Webhook verification: SDK has **no** webhook operation (map: 5 resources, none is notifications).
+Per task contract + H6 it is done as direct REST against `PAYPAL_API_BASE` using the **same injected
+fetch**: `POST /v1/oauth2/token` (client credentials, token cached in service closure) then
+`POST /v1/notifications/verify-webhook-signature` with `{auth_algo,cert_url,transmission_id,
+transmission_sig,transmission_time}` from `PAYPAL-*` headers + `webhook_id` + `webhook_event`.
