+## Assumptions & Blockers
+- Blocker (accepted, safe): SDK offers no create-order lookup for unknown outcomes — reported
+  unknown, never fulfilled; buyer may start a new checkout. No money can move on an unbound order.
+- Minor: capture route kept unpaid (`pending`, failure noted) on declined/refused captures so the
+  buyer can retry; shop order ids / PayPal ids are the only cross references.
+- Minor: if PayPal env vars are absent at startup, PayPal routes answer 503 and card checkout
+  still runs (harness supplies credentials when it runs the shop).
